WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Now that we've discussed how to stay calm and safe,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.240
let's see an assessment in action.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.360
On the screen is a video called Assessment Example.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.800
Let's watch this together and pay close attention

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.600
to the rescuer's steps.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.160
We'll pause the presentation after to discuss it.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.000
Ella?

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.280
Ella?

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.080
Hey, hey, hey.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.400
Are you okay?

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.360
Are you okay?

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.799
Help!

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:26.639
Help!

00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:28.400
Ella?

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.639
Nine, one, one.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:34.919
Hello?

00:00:34.919 --> 00:00:35.759
Hello?

00:00:37.119 --> 00:00:38.880
12 Peach Tree Street.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.160
My daughter, she's not responsive.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.639
She's not...

00:00:45.639 --> 00:00:48.480
No, I don't think she's breathing.

00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:51.520
Compression?

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.880
Yeah, I can start compressions.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.959
Please hurry!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.119
Hey, I'm gonna stay on the line.

00:00:57.119 --> 00:01:00.160
I'm gonna put you on speakerphone.

